translate schinese_rewrite Ribba_Command_Controller_Lick_ff15710c:

    # "His cheeks burn dark beneath his fur. Every second he holds the lewd pose feels like a battle."
    "他的脸颊在皮毛下烧得暗红。他每多保持一秒这个淫猥的姿势，都仿佛是在进行一场战斗。"

translate schinese_rewrite Ribba_Command_Controller_Lick_b123402c:

    # "You can see the tension in his shoulders — he's trying to fight the command every inch of the way."
    "你能看出他肩膀上的紧绷——他正竭尽全力抵抗这道命令。"

translate schinese_rewrite Ribba_Command_Controller_Lick_2ae1bdf3:

    # rb "Y-yes... as you command. Proper little stage magic, hm?"
    rb "是、是的……遵命。像模像样的小把戏，对吧？"

translate schinese_rewrite Ribba_Command_Controller_Lick_acdf9c23:

    # "Ribba's tongue slides out smoothly and seductively without any resistance."
    "里巴的舌头顺滑而诱人地伸了出来，没有丝毫抗拒。"

translate schinese_rewrite Ribba_Command_Controller_Lick_8c6783ed:

    # "He curls it teasingly, dragging it slowly across his lips while gazing at the crowd."
    "他故意挑逗地蜷了蜷舌头，缓缓舔过双唇，同时望向人群。"

translate schinese_rewrite Ribba_Command_Controller_Lick_8ca0aa55:

    # "His expression is playful and shameless, clearly enjoying putting on the show."
    "他的表情既顽皮又毫不知羞，显然很享受这场表演。"

translate schinese_rewrite Ribba_Command_Controller_Lick_710a9a7a:

    # e "Good boy. Make it nice and wet for them."
    e "乖孩子。让它为他们湿得漂亮点。"

translate schinese_rewrite Ribba_Command_Controller_Lick_24c1cc5c:

    # "A soft, willing hum vibrates around his tongue as he obeys perfectly."
