translate schinese_rewrite Ribba_Command_Controller_Lick_085d3c07:

    # "He even tilts his head, giving the front rows a better view of his slick tongue."
    "他甚至歪了歪头，让前排的人能更清楚地看见他湿润的舌头。"

translate schinese_rewrite Ribba_Command_Controller_Lick_45f50055:

    # "The crowd erupts into delighted applause."
