    "他的双眼抬起来望着你，流露出柔顺的服从。"

translate schinese_rewrite Ribba_Command_Controller_Freeze_4d3db2af:

    # e "Freeze, magician. Hold perfectly still while I play with you in front of everyone."
    e "不许动，魔法师。在我当着所有人的面玩弄你时，给我一动不动。"

translate schinese_rewrite Ribba_Command_Controller_Freeze_c08fbfc1:

    # rb "Don't you dare—"
    rb "你敢——"

translate schinese_rewrite Ribba_Command_Controller_Freeze_eff95eab:

    # "His protest is cut off mid-sentence as the controller locks his body completely."
    "控制器将他的身体彻底锁死，他的抗议戛然而止，话说到一半便没了下文。"

translate schinese_rewrite Ribba_Command_Controller_Freeze_9d5db74f:

    # "Ribba becomes a rigid statue on stage, one paw slightly raised, mouth frozen around his unfinished complaint."
    "里巴在台上变成一尊僵硬的雕像，一只爪子微微抬起，嘴巴僵在那句未完的抱怨上。"

translate schinese_rewrite Ribba_Command_Controller_Freeze_b4a49ec3:

    # "Only his eyes can move — wide with alarm and flashing clear defiance toward you."
    "只有他的双眼还能动——因惊恐而睁得老大，目光中闪烁着对你毫不掩饰的反抗。"

translate schinese_rewrite Ribba_Command_Controller_Freeze_a76149da:

    # "The audience falls silent for a moment, then bursts into curious murmurs."
    "观众安静了片刻，随即爆发出好奇的窃窃私语。"

translate schinese_rewrite Ribba_Command_Controller_Freeze_0df11369:

    # e "Perfect. Look at him, everyone. Completely helpless now."
    e "太完美了。大家看看他。现在完全无力反抗了。"

translate schinese_rewrite Ribba_Command_Controller_Freeze_5223800f:

    # "You step closer and slowly circle him."
    "你走近一些，缓缓绕着他转圈。"

translate schinese_rewrite Ribba_Command_Controller_Freeze_ca8b994c:

    # "You tilt his chin upward with one finger. His frozen eyes follow you with burning protest."
    "你用一根手指抬起他的下巴。他冻结的双眼随着你移动，燃烧着抗议的火焰。"

translate schinese_rewrite Ribba_Command_Controller_Freeze_b2fba5fe:

    # "You run a finger slowly down his chest, tracing his vest while he remains utterly immobile."
    "你用手指沿着他的胸口缓缓下滑，描摹着他的背心，而他始终一动不动。"

translate schinese_rewrite Ribba_Command_Controller_Freeze_eb4b66ca:

    # "A tiny, trapped whimper tries to escape his throat but stays locked inside."
    "一声细微而受困的呜咽试图从他喉咙里逃出，却被锁在了里面。"

translate schinese_rewrite Ribba_Command_Controller_Freeze_b4a5f43d:

    # "His willpower rages behind his eyes, yet his body stays perfectly still."
    "他的意志在双眼后方怒吼，可身体依旧纹丝不动。"

translate schinese_rewrite Ribba_Command_Controller_Freeze_c4720151:

    # e "They love seeing their proud magician like this — frozen and on display."
    e "他们就喜欢看这位骄傲的魔法师被冻成这样，供人观赏。"

translate schinese_rewrite Ribba_Command_Controller_Freeze_3432ca52:

    # "You adjust his pose, spreading his stance slightly and lifting one paw behind his head."
    "你调整他的姿势，让他的双腿稍稍分开，又抬起他的一只爪子，放到脑后。"

translate schinese_rewrite Ribba_Command_Controller_Freeze_817e682d:

    # "The crowd cheers at the provocative frozen position."
    "人群为这挑逗意味十足的冻结姿势欢呼起来。"

translate schinese_rewrite Ribba_Command_Controller_Freeze_c0ad22a3:

    # "His body locks instantly into a graceful, obedient pose."
    "他的身体瞬间定格成优雅而顺从的姿势。"

translate schinese_rewrite Ribba_Command_Controller_Freeze_83d84827:

