    "你绕着他转圈，双手缓缓抚过他的身体两侧，还调整着他的姿势，让它更具挑逗意味。"

translate schinese_rewrite Ribba_Command_Controller_Freeze_a8e3fa70:

    # "Ribba's eyes sparkle with submissive excitement even though he cannot move."
    "即使无法动弹，里巴的双眼里仍闪烁着顺从的兴奋。"

translate schinese_rewrite Ribba_Command_Controller_Freeze_61851760:

    # "You tilt his chin up and spread his stance wider."
    "你抬起他的下巴，让他的双腿分得更开。"

translate schinese_rewrite Ribba_Command_Controller_Freeze_47099a6c:

    # "A soft, muffled sound of pleasure vibrates in his throat — the only thing the freeze allows."
    "一阵柔和而闷住的愉悦声在他喉咙里震颤——这是冻结状态唯一允许他发出的声音。"

translate schinese_rewrite Ribba_Command_Controller_Freeze_5ec6efa6:

