    "他的声音微微发颤，脸颊因屈辱与反抗而涨得通红。"

translate schinese_rewrite Ribba_Command_Controller_Freeze_55dc71d5:

    # "He quickly tries to smooth his clothing and regain composure."
    "他赶忙试着抚平衣服，重新恢复镇定。"

translate schinese_rewrite Ribba_Command_Controller_Freeze_e8d383cf:

    # rb "How was that, then? Made a pretty enough statue for your little show?"
    rb "这下满意了？给你那场小表演做了尊够漂亮的雕像吧？"

translate schinese_rewrite Ribba_Command_Controller_Freeze_fbe3ad28:

